    "importance": "featured",
    "selection_reason": "Strong vibrotactile sensing framework for dexterous manipulation. Novel contact+slip representation decouples sensing from control, enabling sim-to-real transfer without audio simulation. Evaluated across 5 diverse contact-rich tasks with real-robot deployment on LEAP Hand+xArm7. Slip magnitude channel identified as key driver. Fills a gap in tactile sensing for dexterous manipulation on the board.",
